        "content": "## 1. Schedule & Sheet Data Retrieval\n\nThis workflow starts automatically on a defined schedule (e.g., daily or hourly).\n\nIt retrieves the next Google Sheet row marked as ‘Pending’.\n\nThe sheet should include columns like:\n1. Post Description\n2. Status\n3. Image link\n4. Output\n5. Post Link\n6. Text Instructions\n7. Image Instructions\n\nrow_number (required for updates)\n\nEnsure your Google Sheets credentials are correctly configured.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 420
